@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start the process, we receive the contract for the marketing campaign;
:we take it to the department;
:we input the customer's details into NKE;
:If the customer's details;
:v1: are the customer's details ready ({missing, ready}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'missing'])
:we contact the customers;
:we receive additional customer details;
-> after receiving details;
:we create the team;
else ([v1 = 'ready'])
:we create a suitable team;
endif
:check previous campaigns for reusable material;
:Upon finding reusable ideas from previous campaigns;
:we create a new concept;
:we integrate new ideas and add further points;
:we integrate the revised campaign into the database;
repeat :;
:The concept is then presented to the relevant party for consideration;
:If the concept is declined;
:v3: was the concept accepted ({declined, accepted}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:we rework it;
repeat while () is ([v3 = 'declined']) not ([v3 = 'accepted'])
:we proceed to present it to the customer;
stop
